---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import documents from '../../data/documents.json';
import DocLinks from '../../components/DocLinks.astro';
---
<Layout title_cy="Polisi Bioamrywiaeth" title_en="Biodiversity Policy">
  <div class="page-banner"><h1><span lang="cy">Polisi Bioamrywiaeth</span><span lang="en">Biodiversity Policy</span></h1></div>
  <div class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/"><span lang="cy">Hafan</span><span lang="en">Home</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <a href="/documents/"><span lang="cy">Dogfennau</span><span lang="en">Documents</span></a> &rsaquo;
    <span lang="cy">Bioamrywiaeth</span><span lang="en">Biodiversity</span>
  </div>
  <div class="site-wrap"><div class="content" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2 class="sh"><span lang="cy">Polisi Bioamrywiaeth a Gwydnwch Ecosystemau</span><span lang="en">Biodiversity and Ecosystem Resilience Policy</span></h2><hr class="sh-rule">

    <p lang="cy">O dan Ddeddf yr Amgylchedd (Cymru) 2016, mae dyletswydd ar Gyngor Cymuned Llansannan i gynnal a gwella bioamrywiaeth wrth gyflawni ei swyddogaethau. Mae'r polisi hwn yn nodi sut rydym yn cyflawni'r ddyletswydd honno.</p>
    <p lang="en">Under the Environment (Wales) Act 2016, Llansannan Community Council has a duty to maintain and enhance biodiversity when carrying out its functions. This policy sets out how we fulfil that duty.</p>

    <h3 class="sub-sh"><span lang="cy">Ein hymrwymiadau</span><span lang="en">Our commitments</span></h3>
    <ul lang="cy">
      <li>Ystyried effaith ar fioamrywiaeth wrth wneud penderfyniadau</li>
      <li>Annog planhigion brodorol ac amrywiaeth ecolegol yn y cymunedau rydym yn eu gwasanaethu</li>
      <li>Cyfrannu at gynlluniau cenedlaethol fel Bioamrywiaeth 2030</li>
      <li>Adrodd yn flynyddol ar gamau gweithredu</li>
    </ul>
    <ul lang="en">
      <li>Consider biodiversity impact when making decisions</li>
      <li>Encourage native plants and ecological variety in the communities we serve</li>
      <li>Contribute to national schemes such as Biodiversity 2030</li>
      <li>Report annually on actions taken</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="minutes-list" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <div class="minutes-item">
        <div>
          <strong><span lang="cy">Polisi Bioamrywiaeth — yn cael ei lunio</span><span lang="en">Biodiversity Policy — being drafted</span></strong>
          <div class="fg-meta"><span lang="cy">2025–2030</span><span lang="en">2025–2030</span></div>
        </div>
        <DocLinks doc={documents.biodiversity} />
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem">
      <a href="https://www.biodiversitywales.org.uk" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" lang="cy">Bioamrywiaeth Cymru →</a>
      <a href="https://www.biodiversitywales.org.uk" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" lang="en">Biodiversity Wales →</a>
    </p>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
